 unfinished title from first time developers and you get more what is going on in this game.", "timestamp_created": 1766787891, "timestamp_updated": 1766790845, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 14, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.645902693271636963", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213214156", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045476310", "personaname": "EnormousConsultation", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Whecking/", "num_games_owned": 975, "num_reviews": 225, "playtime_forever": 20, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 20, "last_played": 1682236655, "avatar": "e359eda98b76c1ccce1aeda6a067ae6e55da2c66"}, "language": "english", "review": "Enemies don't immerse me into the game", "timestamp_created": 1765648048, "timestamp_updated": 1765648048, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213185351", "author": {"steamid": "76561198775009130", "personaname": "The Prince of Finland", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198775009130/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 146, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 146, "last_played": 1765621445, "avatar": "8442685651231b08503c282a75c5f324df2ae085"}, "language": "english", "review": "Me and my friend found keys for 0.50€ \n\nWhich is the maximum anybody should ever pay for this game\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1765621626, "timestamp_updated": 1765621626, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 7, "weighted_vote_score": "0.561584830284118652", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212669873", "author": {"steamid": "76561198308458397", "personaname": "xX_BL00DYT4MP0N_Xx", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mepepperonis/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 60, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 60, "last_played": 1764644694, "avatar": "fbe1ffec7bebf2dc2b7ad61bfb47bdd0b9cd6ad1"}, "language": "english", "review": "I don't care how desperate for a Left 4 Dead successor you are, don't waste your time. Hoards are unfun ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ to deal with, otherwise the zombies are painfully dumb and easy to deal with including the game's version of the tank special infected. Voice acting is some of the worst I've ever heard in a game. The characters are bland with no real personality, and it doesn't feel like you're actually part of a team working together to survive an apocalypse. The entire game lacks any real personality. Locations are boring and feel like mazes half the time, especially when you're in a level where every area looks the same. Gunplay and combat feel sloppy, and the physics and character animations are unnatural and stiff at times(the taunts and dances are scary af to look at). The game is just generally not very fun at all and kind of a miserable experience. I played this with my boyfriend, and, while we can usually still have fun with a ♥♥♥♥♥♥ game when we play together, co-op isn't enough to even find ironic enjoyment. Let's just accept that we will never get a L4D3 in any form and move on.", "timestamp_created": 1765002766, "timestamp_updated": 1765002766, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.588722884654998779", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212300947", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057636632", "personaname": "Mongrek21", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198057636632/", "num_games_owned": 495, "num_reviews": 185, "playtime_forever": 398, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 398, "deck_playtime_at_review": 2, "last_played": 1752331317, "avatar": "0adc80f8746eebc6b6779c30dae8e87635c46f5f"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game made me furry", "timestamp_created": 1764594255, "timestamp_updated": 1764594255, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.42119637131690979", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}]}